From: Julian Cooper <115541810+Juliansgith@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:34:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 28/52] Add /netdiag: log the client manager's beat bookkeeping
 every 5 s

With /netdiag on the command line, a background thread calls the active
sim driver's CClientManagerImpl::Debug() every five seconds: each
client's queued/dispatched beats and latest acks, and the manager's
available/fully-queued/partially-queued beats. Used to find why replay
playback stopped dispatching beats (the local client's ack slot was
never advanced). Inert without the switch.

(cherry picked from commit 4e10dc3662e9b7dd237a0b89d86ff3dcf5b213f1)

Ported onto 8977bb9d: SIM_GetActiveDriver is WLD_GetDriver (CWldSession.h) upstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 06e94d3e0d36014d33f2e5999ad6834d3065dcc4)
---
 src/sdk/moho/agent/AgentBridge.cpp | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 30 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/sdk/moho/agent/AgentBridge.cpp b/src/sdk/moho/agent/AgentBridge.cpp
index 36359ce8..83ff9efb 100644
--- a/src/sdk/moho/agent/AgentBridge.cpp
+++ b/src/sdk/moho/agent/AgentBridge.cpp
@@ -23,7 +23,10 @@
 #include "legacy/containers/Vector.h"
 #include "lua/LuaObject.h"
 #include "moho/misc/StartupHelpers.h"
+#include "moho/net/CClientManagerImpl.h"
+#include "moho/sim/CWldSession.h"
 #include "moho/sim/Sim.h"
+#include "moho/sim/SimDriver.h"
 #include "platform/X87Precision.h"
 
 // Engine addition, not recovered from the binary. See AgentBridge.h for the protocol.
@@ -1055,6 +1058,33 @@ namespace moho
     }
   } // namespace
 
+  namespace
+  {
+    // Diagnostics (engine addition): with /netdiag, dump the client manager's beat bookkeeping (queued,
+    // dispatched and available beats per client, readiness) to the log every five seconds -- for
+    // finding out why a session (e.g. a replay) stops dispatching beats.
+    struct NetDiagnosticsStarter
+    {
+      NetDiagnosticsStarter()
+      {
+        if (!CFG_GetArgOption("/netdiag", 0, nullptr)) {
+          return;
+        }
+        std::thread([] {
+          for (;;) {
+            ::Sleep(5000);
+            if (ISTIDriver* const driver = WLD_GetDriver(); driver != nullptr) {
+              if (CClientManagerImpl* const clientManager = driver->GetClientManager(); clientManager != nullptr) {
+                clientManager->Debug();
+              }
+            }
+          }
+        }).detach();
+      }
+    };
+    const NetDiagnosticsStarter gNetDiagnosticsStarter{};
+  } // namespace
+
   void AGENT_OnSimBeatStart()
   {
     if (Config().enabled) {
